  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing the \"No Results\" Component**\n\nI\'m starting the design process for `frontend/src/design-system/primitives/NoResultsFound.tsx`. My focus is on creating a reusable component for the empty state, specifically when search filters yield no ads, and ensuring it includes a \"Clear filters\" button. I\'m also considering how to best support customization while maintaining consistency.\n\n\n**Defining Component Props**\n\nI\'ve fleshed out the props for the `NoResultsFound` component. I\'ve focused on smart defaults for internationalization with title and description, handling custom queries with a label, and clear filter options. I\'m also considering `secondaryAction`, `onSaveSearch`, and optional search suggestions. I\'m aiming for flexibility and user guidance through the props I\'ve laid out.\n\n\n**Refining Component Aesthetics**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the visual details. No cheesy effects, just sophisticated neutrals for the `NoResultsFound` component. I\'m paying strict attention to padding, radii, and interactive elements to ensure visual coherence and user-friendliness. Accessibility is paramount, so proper ARIA labels and roles are being implemented for screen readers. I\'m also planning to create a comprehensive test suite to cover all use cases.\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 5
      nanos: 80534141
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
