  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Expanding Search Control**\n\nI\'ve added methods to the `storageService` for complete recent search management: `clearRecentSearches()` and `removeRecentSearch(query)`. Now I\'m shifting focus to designing the autocomplete feature \342\200\223 time to check out its architecture.\n\n\n**Defining Suggestion Types**\n\nI\'m currently focused on determining the types of suggestions we\'ll offer. I\'m thinking of incorporating popular keywords, defined within a configuration file, along with category suggestions. I\'ll need to define how we\'ll match categories and subcategories based on the user\'s input, like \"voitur\" or \"velo.\" I\'m also considering how we\'ll handle the display and ranking of these suggestions.\n\n\n**Defining Suggestion Details**\n\nMy focus is now on the presentation and behavior of the suggestions. Category suggestions will include their full path (e.g., `Vehicles > Cars`) and an `CategoryIcon`. Clicking these can filter by that category or pre-populate the search. Keyword suggestions will filter from both popular keywords and recent searches. I\'m also planning to suggest search modifiers, such as \"Search [query] in [active category]\".\n\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 6
      nanos: 439273160
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
